A '''sentient species''' of [[cephalopod]]-like [[humanoid]]s lived in [[the galaxy]].<ref name="TROS VD" /> During the [[Great Jedi Purge]], one member of this species was among the refugees on [[Jabiim]] who were given passage to [[Tessen]] aboard [[Kawlan Roken]]'s [[JT-731 Broadhorn transport|Jabiim freight transport]]. Another member was [[Dynym Quid]], who spent time in the [[Canto Casino and Racetrack|Canto Casino]] in the [[city]] of [[Canto Bight]] on the [[planet]] [[Cantonica]] in [[34 ABY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]'' dates the events of [[Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'']], which includes the appearance of Dynym Quid, to the same [[Standard year|year]] as the [[Battle of Starkiller Base]], which ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates to [[34 ABY]].</ref>

